WEBVTT

00:36.068 --> 00:42.531
The city sleeps in shades of grey Another dawn

00:42.551 --> 00:49.615
begins Another street, another day When no one

00:49.955 --> 00:57.259
ever wins A hollow echo in the square A promise

00:57.339 --> 01:02.802
whispered low Or somewhere else beyond compare

01:04.152 --> 01:09.036
A place where true things grow The faces blur, a

01:09.116 --> 01:15.621
passing stream A river deep and wide Lost in a

01:15.681 --> 01:21.385
half-forgoing dream Where do the lost ones

01:21.445 --> 01:27.868
hide? Do you hear I? A whisper on the wind, a

01:27.968 --> 01:34.369
melody so clear Oh, the true light gleams

01:38.290 --> 01:42.411
Will you come back to where the true light gleams

01:42.511 --> 01:44.852
And home is always near

02:00.997 --> 02:07.542
We chase the shadows on the wall Illusions that

02:07.582 --> 02:13.627
we build Afraid to leap, afraid to fall A

02:13.687 --> 02:18.310
prophesy fulfilled The painted smiles a

02:18.350 --> 02:25.036
masquerade To hide the fading spark A fragile

02:25.096 --> 02:31.226
fortress we have made Against the growing dark,

02:31.826 --> 02:38.988
but in the distance I can see A shimmer in the air,

02:39.008 --> 02:45.670
a different kind of mystery A world beyond

02:45.790 --> 02:53.428
compare Do you hear I whisper on the wind a melody

02:53.488 --> 02:59.090
so clear? Oh, the true light gleams.

03:03.090 --> 03:07.171
Will you come back to where the true light gleams

03:07.271 --> 03:09.772
and home is always near?

03:13.152 --> 03:17.221
Through fractured prisms, light divides In

03:17.281 --> 03:22.761
pair and sharp and bright Thou sandpats, where

03:22.801 --> 03:28.602
fate presides Between the day and night Is thy

03:28.702 --> 03:35.825
abidance just a trace? A trick of weary eyes? Or

03:35.905 --> 03:41.086
is there truly such a place Beneath those

03:41.226 --> 03:47.968
shifting skies? Shelter from the endless rain A

03:47.988 --> 03:55.638
refuge from the cold A story waiting to unfold,

03:56.758 --> 04:00.020
again to

04:00.480 --> 04:00.680
be

04:15.446 --> 04:16.867
told.

04:33.355 --> 04:39.537
Do you hear it? A whisper on the wind, a melody so

04:39.617 --> 04:44.599
